      "writtenOn": "2025-11-06T15:17:14Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Sure, fewer dependencies is nice.\n\nMy motivation here is that you always ask for .in files, and I want to add \u003e 100 jbig2 test cases, and I can\u0027t manually do this conversion.\n\nIt\u0027s easy to re-run the script once it improves and produces nicer output.\n\nIn the meantime, having some automation seems better than not having it?",
      "parentUuid": "0e66c7e8_10a8c854",
